---
title: "A lease on one key"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: key free
    lg1: lease held
    lg2: lease ran out
    lg3: old holder at work
  }
  class lg0 tan
  class lg1 teal
  class lg2 orange
  class lg3 purple
  s0: Key free
  s1: Lease held
  s2: Lease held, holder's transaction open
  s3: Lease ran out, holder not told yet
  s4: Old holder still at work on its old fence
  s5: Lease ran out, nobody holds the key
  s6: Lease ran out, holder's transaction still open
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: a worker claims the key
  s1 --> s2: the holder's fence is accepted
  s1 --> s3: the lease's time runs out
  s1 --> s4: someone cancels the key
  s2 --> s1: the holder's heartbeat commits
  s2 --> s0: the holder commits and releases the key
  s2 --> s6: the lease's time runs out
  s3 --> s5: the holder's fence is refused, its lease ran out
  s3 --> s4: someone cancels the key or another worker takes the key over
  s4 --> s0: the old holder's fence is refused [key is free]
  s5 --> s0: someone cancels the key
  s6 --> s1: the holder's heartbeat commits
  s6 --> s0: the holder commits and releases the key
  s5 --> s1: a worker claims the key
  s4 --> s1: the old holder's fence is refused [newer lease is held]
  s4 --> s3: the old holder's fence is refused [newer lease ran out, its holder not told yet]
  s4 --> s5: the old holder's fence is refused [newer lease ran out, nobody holds the key]
  class s0 tan
  class s1 teal
  class s2 teal
  class s3 orange
  class s4 purple
  class s5 orange
  class s6 orange
